# Module

## Package Script Set: Common Scripts

**Scripts:**

- Package Script: Lint
  - Purpose: Check formatting, lint, and type check
  - Command: `prettier . -c && eslint . && tsc --noEmit`

- Package Script: Lint Fix
  - Purpose: Fix formatting and lint issues
  - Command: `prettier . -c --write && eslint . --fix`

- Package Script: Build Clean
  - Purpose: Remove build artifacts
  - Command: `rm -rf dist`

- Package Script: CI
  - Purpose: Run CI pipeline
  - Command: `npm run lint && npm run build && npm run test`

- Package Script: Test
  - Purpose: Run tests
  - Command: `echo none yet`
